    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>12 weeks, May 4 - Jul 26.</div><div><br/></div><ul><li>Average 8.6 h/week (plan said 9-10). Two holes: NeurIPS deadline week (5.1 h) and the week of Jul 27 coming up (rebuttal + leave paperwork; expect ~6).</li><li>Long run peaked at 1:52 (14.3 mi) on 7/11.</li><li>Resting HR 7-day avg: 46 (from 49 in Jan).</li><li>Easy pace at 150 bpm: 7:48 (from 8:15).</li><li>Decoupling on 100'+ runs: 3-5%.</li><li>Track mile 6/6: 4:49.6. small win.</li><li>Missed: hills. only did hill reps 3 times.</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>For Block 4: the move to SF is 8/8, so week of 8/3 is a write-off. Start Block 4 properly on 8/10. SF has hills whether I like it or not.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
